<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Dong A Pharm H1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dong A Pharm H1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 669    vs   675</p>
<p>    Net					   5.56 vs     5.53</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 7.92 vs     7.54</p>
<p>    Turnover				  141.82 vs   130.04</p>
<p>Note - Dong A Pharmaceutical Co Ltd is South Korea's largest pharmaceutical maker. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
